// GPU smoke test scene (tests/smoke/test_crt_presets.cpp, I5 step 6, ADR-0016 §7): four CRTs on pedestals along the
// north wall of a small room, their screens at eye height showing the colour bars, one for each CRT preset of
// assets/materials/crt_presets.json as the case's video.json names them (rooms.crt_presets.screens.<id>.crtPreset; the
// room's id is the scene's name): crt_neutral (the first, the hero), crt_consumer, crt_arcade and crt_monitor
// (secondaries). The camera stands 4.9 m from the wall facing it, all four screens in view; the test's close-ups stand
// the camera 0.64 m in front of one screen (its picture about 1,150 rows of a 2560 x 1440 screenshot: a scanline over
// about 4.8 pixels). Room interior 8 x 7 m centred on the origin (x in [-4, 4], z in [-3.5, 3.5]), doorway in the south
// wall. Run it on its own (without the case's video.json every tube is the consumer one) with
//   retroverse.exe --scene tests/smoke/scenes/crt_presets.json --exit-after-frames --frames 5 --hidden
//     --screenshot build/screenshots/crt_presets.png --data-dir build/rvdata
